/-!
# Actual own-history containment and conditional-expectation tower

Sources: `sources/zip4/manuscript/05_binary_transport.tex:74-124,293-345`,
`sources/zip4/manuscript/06_interruptions.tex:376-426,459-490`,
`sources/zip4/manuscript/07_public_setup.tex:121-164`, and
`sources/zip4/manuscript/appendix_a_local_protocol.tex:28-79`.

This module keeps the complete reference execution on the original source
space. Its enlarged analysis field is generated by literal source coordinates,
the actual own-history prefix, and the encoded incoming states. It makes no
claim that this enlargement is exactly a manuscript filtration.
-/

@[expose] public section

noncomputable section

